      <p class="mt-4 text-base text-ink/70 leading-relaxed">Most beginners are not failing.</p>
      <p class="mt-4 text-base text-ink/70 leading-relaxed">They are simply learning something difficult slowly.</p>
      <p class="mt-4 text-base text-ink/70 leading-relaxed">And honestly, that process can become one of the most rewarding parts of learning music.</p>

